00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
WIOA: Workforce Innovation and Opportunity Act — federal funding for job
training administered through local WorkOne offices.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
WRG: Workforce Ready Grant — Indiana state funding for high-demand
certifications, no income requirements.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
ITA: Individual Training Account — the WIOA funding mechanism that pays your
tuition directly to the training provider.

